    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA fantastic opportunity to purchase an excellent family home in the highly sought-after and well established development of Glenview.No. 235 Glenview Park is a three-bedroom end of terrace property that comes with the huge added bonus of a garage to the side, which can be easily converted to encorporate a playroom, second sitting room, office or fourth bedroom.\nAccommodation breifly comprises; Sitting room to the front, with living room to the rear, alongside a separate galley kitchen and access to side garage.Upstairs, there are three bedrooms (two double) a family bathroom completes the accommodation.The property majorly benefits from not being overlooked and the large garden space can accommodate for further extension without sacrificing your garden space.Glenview Park is located less than a 2 minute drive from Tallaght village, providing every possible amenity, from shops and cafes to bars and restaurants. \nNo. 235 is within easy reach of the Luas Red Line to the city centre and buses are a couple of minutes' walk from the front door.The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght Hospital, cinemas, the Civic Theatre, the TU Dublin College Campus and primary and secondary schools are all within walking distance, along with a public park and enclosed children's playground located next to the estate entrance.This is a fantastic opportunity to purchase a beautiful three bedroom home in the ideal estate to raise a family.Call or email for viewing details."
      },
